        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # Define variables name and value\n    option_type = \"call\"\n    strike_price = 0.03\n    premium = 0.015\n    yield_at_expiry = 0.035\n    multiplier = 100\n\n    # Do math calculation to get the answer\n    option_value_at_expiry = yield_at_expiry * multiplier\n    option_value_at_strike = strike_price * multiplier\n    intrinsic_value = max(0, option_value_at_expiry - option_value_at_strike)\n    profit_loss = intrinsic_value - (premium * multiplier)\n\n    # return answer\n    return round(profit_loss)\n```",
